Inevitable mark and this composition
Copyright (c) 2026 Sal (metasal1)

The capital-I mark is a derived community mark for the Inevitable newsletter.
Its parallelogram geometry is taken from the official Solana logo mark
(Solana Foundation). Official rounding is kept.

This is not an official Solana logo, not an official Solana ANZ logo, and
does not claim any Solana trademark. Do not use this mark to imply
endorsement by the Solana Foundation or Solana ANZ.

